        { "host": "A", "text": "Futures and Concepts Command becomes Futures and Autonomous Systems Command, FASCOM, led by a three-star general. The Association of the US Army reports Gen. Christopher LaNeve announced it on October 13th, after the acting Army Secretary directed it on October 1st." },
