{"filePath":"/home/user/ainews/data/2026-10-14.script.json","oldString":"        { "host": "B", "text": "Which brings us to the machines and the money, and today they point in opposite directions." }","newString":"        { "host": "B", "text": "Which brings us to the machines and the money. Two reports today, one on each." }","originalFile":"{
  "date": "2026-10-14",
